### API 1 - GET all todos (optionally filtered)
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 1: Filter by status
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?status=TO%20DO
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 2: Filter by priority
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?priority=HIGH
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 3: Filter by priority and status
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?priority=HIGH&status=IN%20PROGRESS
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 4: Search by todo text
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?search_q=Buy
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 5: Filter by category and status
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?category=WORK&status=DONE
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 6: Filter by category
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?category=HOME
Content-Type: application/json

### Scenario 7: Filter by category and priority
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/?category=LEARNING&priority=HIGH
Content-Type: application/json

---

### API 2 - GET todo by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/todos/1/
Content-Type: application/json

---

### API 3 - GET todos by due date (/agenda/)
GET http://localhost:3000/agenda/?date=2021-02-22
Content-Type: application/json

---

### API 4 - POST /todos/ (Create a new todo)
POST http://localhost:3000/todos/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "todo": "Finalize event theme",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "TO DO",
  "category": "HOME",
  "dueDate": "2021-02-22"
}

---

### API 5 - PUT /todos/:todoId/ (Update a todo)
### Scenario 1 - Update status
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/6/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### Scenario 2 - Update priority
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/6/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Scenario 3 - Update todo text
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/6/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "todo": "Clean the garden"
}

### Scenario 4 - Update category
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/6/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "LEARNING"
}

### Scenario 5 - Update due date
PUT http://localhost:3000/todos/6/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2021-01-12"
}

---

### API 6 - DELETE /todos/:todoId/ (Delete a todo)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/todos/6/
Content-Type: application/json
